  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "...\nT’es détective, toi ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E000A00542019006500730020006400E90074006500630074006900760065002C00200074006F00690020003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En effet.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000650066006600650074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je fais l’intérim.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000660061006900730020006C20190069006E007400E900720069006D002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, si Millie te fait assez confiance\npour t’envoyer à sa place, ça me va.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Car Illumis est en danger !\nUne terrible menace pèse sur la ville !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061007200200049006C006C0075006D00690073002000650073007400200065006E002000640061006E00670065007200200021000A0055006E00650020007400650072007200690062006C00650020006D0065006E0061006300650020007000E80073006500200073007500720020006C0061002000760069006C006C00650020002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il s’agit...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020007320190061006700690074002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... d’un énooorme...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020006420190075006E002000E9006E006F006F006F0072006D0065002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Sapereau !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E002000530061007000650072006500610075002000210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est au moins deux fois plus grand que\nle mien ! Et c’est pas tout...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSes yeux... ils brillent d’un éclat malfaisant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand nos regards se sont croisés,\nj’ai pris mes jambes à mon cou !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’en ai visité, des régions, et j’en ai vu,\ndes trucs ! Mais j’ai jamais eu peur comme ça.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 166
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et le pire dans cette histoire, c’est que\nje l’ai rencontré dans une ruelle banale !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMême pas dans une zone sauvage !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On ne peut pas le laisser là ! Enregistre ma\nmission dans ton Motismart et rends-toi<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nà l’endroit indiqué par le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>marqueur<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est ici que j’ai vu le Sapereau géant...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh là là, ça y est, j’ai la trouille...\nJ’en ai les genoux qui tremblent !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sape ?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061007000650020003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qui va pas, partenaire ?!\nMe dis pas que... c’est LUI ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500690020007600610020007000610073002C002000700061007200740065006E00610069007200650020003F0021000A004D0065002000640069007300200070006100730020007100750065002E002E002E0020006320190065007300740020004C005500490020003F002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "PEREAU !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500045005200450041005500200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est GROS !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020006500730074002000470052004F00530020002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il fait PEUR !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C00200066006100690074002000500045005500520020002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais il est TROP COOL !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200069006C0020006500730074002000540052004F005000200043004F004F004C0020002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas de doute possible !\nC’est bien LUI !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200064006500200064006F00750074006500200070006F0073007300690062006C006500200021000A004320190065007300740020006200690065006E0020004C00550049002000210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SAPE SAPE !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530041005000450020005300410050004500200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’y crois pas, t’as battu cet énorme Sapereau !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190079002000630072006F006900730020007000610073002C002000742019006100730020006200610074007400750020006300650074002000E9006E006F0072006D00650020005300610070006500720065006100750020002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais quoi ? Votre combat m’a rappelé\nune rumeur...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200073006100690073002000710075006F00690020003F00200056006F00740072006500200063006F006D0062006100740020006D20190061002000720061007000700065006C00E9000A0075006E0065002000720075006D006500750072002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai entendu dire qu’il y a trèèès longtemps,\ndes Pokémon immenses semaient la terreur<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndans une certaine région !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLeurs yeux brillaient aussi, et on les appelait\ndes <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Barons<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 192
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je vois vraiment pas pourquoi un Pokémon\nBaron apparaîtrait de nos jours à Illumis...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que t’en dis, partenaire ?\nÇa donne envie de creuser la question, pas vrai ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pereau...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006500610075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, tu m’as rendu un fier service.\nMillie a eu raison de te faire confiance !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAvec quelqu’un comme toi ici, on est en\nsécurité, même si d’autres Barons apparaissent !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
